WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.234 --> 00:00:02.569 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I did not realize this
about you,

00:00:02.569 --> 00:00:03.737 align:start size:94% position:6%
because it strikes me
that you know what you like --

00:00:03.737 --> 00:00:05.472 size:81% position:41%
you´re very specific
about what you like --

00:00:05.472 --> 00:00:07.607 align:start size:94% position:6%
but you are indecisive?
Is this true?

00:00:07.607 --> 00:00:10.477 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, my God, yes.
-Yeah.

00:00:10.477 --> 00:00:13.013
Where does that indecision
most play out in your life?

00:00:13.013 --> 00:00:15.248 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, whether or not
I was gonna do this show.

00:00:15.248 --> 00:00:16.583 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.

00:00:16.583 --> 00:00:19.819 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:19.819 --> 00:00:22.822 size:84% position:42%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:22.822 --> 00:00:26.192 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You know, they --

00:00:26.192 --> 00:00:28.028 size:78% position:39%
"Larry, they want you
to do Seth Meyers."

00:00:28.028 --> 00:00:30.063 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Um, uh, um...

00:00:30.063 --> 00:00:32.932
Uhhh, I don´t know, maybe."

00:00:32.932 --> 00:00:36.002 align:start size:94% position:6%
-[ Laughs ]
-No, I was very indecisive.

00:00:36.002 --> 00:00:37.971 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, I´m glad
you decided to come.

00:00:37.971 --> 00:00:39.572 align:start size:94% position:6%
How are you feeling
about the decision?

00:00:39.572 --> 00:00:41.007 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Not good, not good.
-Yeah.

00:00:41.007 --> 00:00:42.342 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:42.342 --> 00:00:44.344 align:start size:94% position:6%
-When I used to -- When I had
an apartment in New York

00:00:44.344 --> 00:00:47.147
and I didn´t have any money,
I couldn´t decide what to eat.

00:00:47.147 --> 00:00:49.449 align:start size:94% position:6%
I would go to the corner
of 43rd Street and 9th Avenue.

00:00:49.449 --> 00:00:51.351 align:start size:94% position:6%
I would stand there
for 15 minutes,

00:00:51.351 --> 00:00:54.287
thinking of the five restaurants
that I could afford to go to.

00:00:54.287 --> 00:00:57.757
And it was so overwhelming,
I had to go back and go home.

00:00:57.757 --> 00:00:59.125 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That was it?
-That was it.

00:00:59.125 --> 00:01:00.360 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You couldn´t even pick
a restaurant?

00:01:00.360 --> 00:01:01.561
-I couldn´t pick the restaurant.

00:01:01.561 --> 00:01:03.496 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You´re back here
for the premiere of the show.

00:01:03.496 --> 00:01:06.332 size:84% position:42%
Coming from Brooklyn,
growing up in Brooklyn,

00:01:06.332 --> 00:01:08.101
do you have any nostalgia
for being back in New York?

00:01:08.101 --> 00:01:09.569 align:start size:94% position:6%
-[ Laughs ]
-[ Chuckling ] No?

00:01:09.569 --> 00:01:12.205
No nostalgia for your youth?
-I-I-I don´t get that way.

00:01:12.205 --> 00:01:14.074 align:start size:94% position:6%
You could put me back
in my own bed,

00:01:14.074 --> 00:01:15.442
it wouldn´t make a difference.

00:01:15.442 --> 00:01:16.743 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:16.743 --> 00:01:19.079 align:start size:94% position:6%
No, Brooklyn was a good place
to grow up, though.

00:01:19.079 --> 00:01:22.248 align:start size:94% position:6%
-How so?
-Well, it was fun.

00:01:22.248 --> 00:01:25.585 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know, you played baseball
on concrete.

00:01:25.585 --> 00:01:27.320 align:start size:94% position:6%
That was fun.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:27.320 --> 00:01:29.389 align:start size:94% position:6%
But there was no nature
in Brooklyn.

00:01:29.389 --> 00:01:31.424 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know,
the only grass I ever saw

00:01:31.424 --> 00:01:32.959 align:start size:94% position:6%
was on the divider
of the Belt Parkway.

00:01:32.959 --> 00:01:34.394 align:start size:94% position:6%
-[ Laughs ]
-That was it.

00:01:34.394 --> 00:01:36.229 align:start size:94% position:6%
And you know,
there were no flowers.

00:01:36.229 --> 00:01:38.832 size:78% position:39%
Just artificial ones
and artificial fruit.

00:01:38.832 --> 00:01:40.500 align:start size:94% position:6%
Every apartment had

00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:42.902 align:start size:94% position:6%
artificial flowers
and artificial fruit.

00:01:42.902 --> 00:01:45.572 align:start size:94% position:6%
People took great pride
in their artificial fruit.

00:01:45.572 --> 00:01:48.541 size:84% position:42%
The greatest compliment
you could give someone

00:01:48.541 --> 00:01:50.777 align:start size:94% position:6%
is to take a bite
of their artificial fruit.

00:01:50.777 --> 00:01:52.011 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:52.011 --> 00:01:53.880 align:start size:94% position:6%
Accidentally, thinking
it was real fruit.

00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:56.583 align:start size:94% position:6%
They would go crazy.
They´d remember it for years.

00:01:56.583 --> 00:01:58.785 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Larry, remember the time
you took a bite of the apple?

00:01:58.785 --> 00:02:00.687 align:start size:94% position:6%
The artificial apple?"
-Yeah.

00:02:00.687 --> 00:02:03.389 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I couldn´t smell
the flower anyway,

00:02:03.389 --> 00:02:04.924 align:start size:94% position:6%
because I was born

00:02:04.924 --> 00:02:06.893
with the ability
to only smell disgusting things.

00:02:06.893 --> 00:02:08.094 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, really?
-Yeah.

00:02:08.094 --> 00:02:09.229 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:09.229 --> 00:02:10.296 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Immediately,
if you walk in a room,

00:02:10.296 --> 00:02:11.965
can you clock it right away?

00:02:11.965 --> 00:02:14.167 align:start size:94% position:6%
-A lilac, you could shove
up my nose, nothing.

00:02:14.167 --> 00:02:17.103 align:start size:94% position:6%
Urine and B.O., I can smell
from three blocks away.

00:02:17.103 --> 00:02:18.638 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It´s a gift.
-Yeah, it´s a gift.

00:02:18.638 --> 00:02:21.574 align:start size:94% position:6%
-This is very strange to me,
because there are people

00:02:21.574 --> 00:02:23.877 align:start size:94% position:6%
who actually are
such a fan of yours,

00:02:23.877 --> 00:02:25.812 align:start size:94% position:6%
they have gotten
Larry David tattoos.

00:02:25.812 --> 00:02:26.946 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Mm-hmm.

00:02:26.946 --> 00:02:28.848 align:start size:94% position:6%
-These are real tattoos
that I´m showing.

00:02:28.848 --> 00:02:30.583 line:0%
There is one that someone got.

00:02:30.583 --> 00:02:32.685 align:start size:94% position:6% line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:32.685 --> 00:02:34.687 size:78% position:39% line:0%
There is another one.

00:02:34.687 --> 00:02:36.022 line:0%
Have you met these people?

00:02:36.022 --> 00:02:37.457 align:start size:94% position:6% line:0%
Have you ever
crossed paths with them?

00:02:37.457 --> 00:02:40.960 align:start size:94% position:6% line:0%
-I have crossed paths, yes.
-Are they excited to meet you?

00:02:40.960 --> 00:02:44.097 align:start size:94% position:6%
-First of all,
here´s the thing about that.

00:02:44.097 --> 00:02:47.834 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know, people who are fans,
once they meet me,

00:02:47.834 --> 00:02:50.069 align:start size:94% position:6%
they´re so disappointed
so quickly.

00:02:50.069 --> 00:02:51.738 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-It´s unbelievable.

00:02:51.738 --> 00:02:53.373 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know, like --
in two minutes,

00:02:53.373 --> 00:02:57.110 align:start size:94% position:6%
you can see -- you can see
their -- their face.

00:02:57.110 --> 00:02:59.179 size:78% position:39%
It´s a disappointment
etched on their face.

00:02:59.179 --> 00:03:02.782 align:start size:94% position:6%
It´s like, "This is the guy
I wanted to meet?"

00:03:02.782 --> 00:03:04.384 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:04.384 --> 00:03:06.219 align:start size:94% position:6%
"There´s nothing to him.
There´s nothing."

00:03:06.219 --> 00:03:08.454 align:start size:94% position:6%
"What, am I crazy?"
You know?

00:03:08.454 --> 00:03:11.858 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Could you date a woman
who had a Larry David tattoo?

00:03:11.858 --> 00:03:14.127 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:14.127 --> 00:03:16.062 size:78% position:39%
-I mean, it would be
interesting sexually.

00:03:16.062 --> 00:03:17.263 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.

00:03:17.263 --> 00:03:21.100 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:21.100 --> 00:03:23.636
-You start to get into it,

00:03:23.636 --> 00:03:25.738 size:75% position:38%
and all of a sudden,

00:03:25.738 --> 00:03:27.273 align:start size:94% position:6%
you look down,
you see that on her shoulder.

00:03:27.273 --> 00:03:28.708 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:28.708 --> 00:03:30.276 align:start size:94% position:6%
It would be like
making love to myself.

00:03:30.276 --> 00:03:31.878 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:31.878 --> 00:03:34.113 align:start size:94% position:6%
Which I have done
a couple times.

00:03:34.113 --> 00:03:35.181 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]

